  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nDuring your Main Phase: You can add 1 non-Pendulum
    \"Ryu-Ge\" card from your Deck to your hand, then destroy this card. You can
    only use this effect of \"Sosei Ryu-Ge Mistva\" once per turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect
    ] \nMust be Special Summoned by its own effect. You can only Special Summon \"Sosei
    Ryu-Ge Mistva(s)\" once per turn. If a monster(s) on the field is destroyed by
    battle or card effect, while this card is in your Extra Deck: You can Tribute
    1 Level 10 \"Ryu-Ge\" monster, and if you do, Special Summon this card (this
    is treated as a Ritual Summon), then you can apply this effect.\r\n\u25CF Destroy
    up to 2 cards you control, and if you do, place up to that many \"Ryu-Ge\" Continuous
    Spells from your Deck face-up on your field."
